The '''M-32 light repeating blaster rifle''',<ref name="CGttSWG" /> also known as '''drum blaster''',<ref name="Chapter 8">{{TheMandalorian|Chapter 8: Redemption}}</ref> was a model of [[light repeating blaster]] that was used by [[Carasynthia Dune]] after she received it from [[Din Djarin]].<ref name="Chapter 4" /> She used it in many conflicts, including on [[Sorgan]], and while rescuing [[Din Grogu|Grogu]], during which it jammed, and was fixed by Dune by slamming it against a wall.<ref name="CGttSWG" />

{{Weapon-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
The blaster was identified as drum blaster in the descriptive audio for "[[Chapter 8: Redemption]]."<ref name="Chapter 8" /> It was later identified in ''[[Star Wars Encyclopedia: The Comprehensive Guide to the Star Wars Galaxy]]''.<ref name="CGttSWG" />

